# F11-16 lab input: data-flow diagram of a survey drone and its telemetry radio link.
title Survey drone and its links, version 1
external pilot   Pilot
process  ground  Ground station app
process  ground  Ground radio
external rf      Anyone with a compatible radio
process  drone   Air radio
process  drone   Flight controller
process  drone   Companion computer
process  drone   RC receiver
store    drone   Parameters
store    drone   Flight log [log]
external pilot   RC transmitter
external world   Satellite navigation signals
external world   Motors and propellers
flow Pilot -> Ground station app : mission, commands
flow Ground station app -> Ground radio : frames
flow Ground radio -> Air radio : radio frames
flow Anyone with a compatible radio -> Air radio : radio frames
flow Air radio -> Flight controller : frames
flow Flight controller -> Air radio : telemetry
flow Air radio -> Ground radio : radio telemetry
flow Ground radio -> Ground station app : telemetry
flow RC transmitter -> RC receiver : stick frames
flow RC receiver -> Flight controller : channels
flow Satellite navigation signals -> Flight controller : position fixes
flow Companion computer -> Flight controller : frames
flow Flight controller -> Companion computer : telemetry
flow Parameters -> Flight controller : parameters
flow Flight controller -> Parameters : parameter changes
flow Flight controller -> Flight log : log records
flow Flight controller -> Motors and propellers : motor commands
